 Source: [pinned Avatar](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/tree/47b40521eab921c2756bf9bdb0b0f07fbfdb8c8c/packages/react/src/avatar) and its loading, transition, animation and timeout dependencies at Base UI 1.8.0 immutable `47b40521eab921c2756bf9bdb0b0f07fbfdb8c8c`. Both default detached-probe loading and rendered-image keepMounted loading are implemented. The accepted five T-01 framework substitutions and inherited A-01 refs apply; native image props use Svelte spelling. Svelte snippet identity remains stable during render-owned source changes, so private source-attribute observation also reads status after imperative source mutation, while the React effect requires a dependency change. This observable adaptation has no additional specific acceptance decision recorded. Rationale, before/after ownership, proposed PR and executed test evidence remain in the [Avatar compatibility record](../parity/avatar/compatibility.md) and [verification](../parity/avatar/verification.md). No inherited source bug is silently fixed, no divergent assertion is credited, and landing status does not establish approval or full parity. The separate inventory has 44 ordinary sites/44 variants, no parameterized declarations, three conformance calls and six type assertions; source and acceptance gates are distinct.
+
+## AC-01: proposed bounded Accordion framework interface
+
+Source: pinned [Accordion parts](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/tree/47b40521eab921c2756bf9bdb0b0f07fbfdb8c8c/packages/react/src/accordion), inherited Collapsible/Button/lifecycle helpers at immutable Base UI v1.8.0 `47b40521eab921c2756bf9bdb0b0f07fbfdb8c8c`. The accepted five framework substitutions and A-01 initially undefined refs apply; named generic props/state/value and part/event types represent React namespace aliases. Root defaults retain upstream any. Item-before-Root callbacks, cancellation, array identity, OR-disabled inheritance, DOM-order registration and deprecated keyboard no-ops remain source behavior. Observable timing/ownership adaptations are bounded; no further behavioral correction is approved.
+
+Inherited Button D-03 earns no new credit. Shared Collapsible issues #30/#31/#33 remain preserved source mechanisms; #34 concerns the private lifecycle here because Accordion Root/Item/Header/Trigger state has no transitionStatus. Existing Collapsible runs do not establish Accordion execution. Panel:201 React.Activity remains deferred and uncredited. Evidence and exact applicability are in [compatibility](../parity/accordion/compatibility.md), [component docs](accordion.md) and [verification](../parity/accordion/verification.md). Proposed implementation: [draft PR #35](https://github.com/sveltery/base/pull/35); landing and final-head acceptance are pending. This entry earns no ordinary credit or complete parity claim.
+
+The resumed Accordion review reproduced [#37](https://github.com/sveltery/base/issues/37): pinned hiddenUntilFound restoration follows hidden state, rather than new Panel host identity. Replacements preserve boolean hidden props or authored false overrides until that state changes. Accordion restores this fidelity with separate DOM and paired browser supplements; no behavioral correction is accepted and no ordinary credit is added. Shared Collapsible examination remains separate.
